    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cory Galvin of Jeremy Murphy & Associates is delighted to bring to the market 60 St. Anne’s Park, Turners Cross, Cork.\r\n\r\nNo. 60 is a well-presented, deceptively spacious 3-bedroom terraced property with ample living accommodation. The property is well-maintained and situated directly behind Turners Cross stadium and within a short stroll of Cork city centre, Musgrave Park, and all local amenities to include shops, bars/restaurants and local sports clubs. The property features fully enclosed west-facing rear yard which is maintenance free as well as off-street parking for several cars.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is advised.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of entrance porch, living room, kitchen/dining room, and bedroom. Upstairs there are two large bedrooms and main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the front of the property there is ample off-street parking for up to 3 cars secured behind a low maintenance block wall.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY 2.4m x 2.8m\r\nPVC French style double doors lead into the entrance porch which features neutral décor and stylish Porcelain tiled floors.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM 4.4m x 3.7\r\nThis bright and spacious living room features stylish walnut laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and patio doors providing access to the rear. The living room also has a feature media wall and is extremely generous in size.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING 4.5m x 3.3m\r\nSpacious dual-aspect kitchen/dining area benefiting from timber effect kitchen units, stainless steel sink with draining board, double oven with four-ring hob and plumbing for washing machine. The kitchen is also finished in neutral paint complimented by tiled flooring throughout. Ample space for a dining table and chairs and access to the rear. One centre light and radiator.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 3.5m x 2.9m\r\nSpacious double bedroom on the ground floor accessed courtesy of the living area and featuring window overlooking the side, centre light and radiator. Neutral décor and timber laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nThe stairs and landing are fully carpeted with window overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 3.5m x 4.2m\r\nDouble bedroom featuring timber laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front. Integrated robes.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 3.8m x 3.5m\r\nDouble bedroom featuring timber laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the front. Integrated robes.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM 1.9m x 1.6m\r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating electric shower, washbasin and w.c. One window with frosted glass overlooks the rear. Lino flooring and walls are fully tiled.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe rear of the property is an excellent low-maintenance west-facing space for entertaining and is not overlooked. There is ample space for table and chairs and also ample storage courtesy of a storage shed."
      },
